{"all_articles":[{"anchors":["definition","下半连续函数-lsc"],"bibliography":[{"author":"Stephen Boyd; Lieven Vandenberghe","id":"boyd-convex-optimization","locator":"Exercises 2.10, 2.18, 3.18, 3.57, 3.36, 4.24, 5.30（按原稿HW题号）","source_path":"","title":"Convex Optimization","url":"https://stanford.edu/~boyd/cvxbook/","year":"2004"}],"english_title":"Lower Semicontinuity","external_links":[],"html":"<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<h1>下半连续性（Lower Semicontinuity）</h1>\n<p><a id=\"下半连续函数-lsc\"></a></p>\n<h2>下半连续函数 LSC</h2>\n<p>定义1：<span class=\"math inline\">epi(f)</span> 是闭集，则称 <span class=\"math inline\">f</span> 是下半连续函数。</p>\n<p>定义2：对任意的 <span class=\"math inline\">x\\in \\text{dom} f</span>，和序列 <span class=\"math inline\">\\{y_n\\}, \\lim_{n→∞} y_n = x</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\nf(x) ≤ \\liminf_{n→∞} f(y_n)\n</div>\n<p>则称 <span class=\"math inline\">f</span> 是下半连续函数。</p>\n<p><strong>Note</strong></p>\n<p>这两种定义是等价的。</p>\n<p><img src=\"/MTreeLab/assets/opt.convex-function/sources/lsc_ManimCE_v0.18.0-503b3323f.png\" alt=\"lsc\"/></p>\n<p>对扩展实值函数（extended-real-valued function）应在整个底空间检验序列判据，并允许 <span class=\"math inline\">f(x)=+\\infty</span>；仅在有效定义域内检验不足以推出上境图闭性。</p>\n<p>参考：<a href=\"https://stanford.edu/~boyd/cvxbook/\">教材相应章节 / Reference</a>。</p>\n<section class=\"bibliography\"><h2>参考资料</h2><ol>\n<li id=\"reference-boyd-convex-optimization\"><a href=\"https://stanford.edu/~boyd/cvxbook/\">Convex Optimization</a> — Stephen Boyd; Lieven Vandenberghe · 2004 · Exercises 2.10, 2.18, 3.18, 3.57, 3.36, 4.24, 5.30（按原稿HW题号）</li>\n</ol></section>\n","id":"opt.lower-semicontinuity.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"opt.lower-semicontinuity","resources":[],"schema_version":1,"title":"下半连续性"}],"anchors":["definition","下半连续函数-lsc"],"articles":[{"anchors":["definition","下半连续函数-lsc"],"bibliography":[{"author":"Stephen Boyd; Lieven Vandenberghe","id":"boyd-convex-optimization","locator":"Exercises 2.10, 2.18, 3.18, 3.57, 3.36, 4.24, 5.30（按原稿HW题号）","source_path":"","title":"Convex Optimization","url":"https://stanford.edu/~boyd/cvxbook/","year":"2004"}],"english_title":"Lower Semicontinuity","external_links":[],"html":"<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<h1>下半连续性（Lower Semicontinuity）</h1>\n<p><a id=\"下半连续函数-lsc\"></a></p>\n<h2>下半连续函数 LSC</h2>\n<p>定义1：<span class=\"math inline\">epi(f)</span> 是闭集，则称 <span class=\"math inline\">f</span> 是下半连续函数。</p>\n<p>定义2：对任意的 <span class=\"math inline\">x\\in \\text{dom} f</span>，和序列 <span class=\"math inline\">\\{y_n\\}, \\lim_{n→∞} y_n = x</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\nf(x) ≤ \\liminf_{n→∞} f(y_n)\n</div>\n<p>则称 <span class=\"math inline\">f</span> 是下半连续函数。</p>\n<p><strong>Note</strong></p>\n<p>这两种定义是等价的。</p>\n<p><img src=\"/MTreeLab/assets/opt.convex-function/sources/lsc_ManimCE_v0.18.0-503b3323f.png\" alt=\"lsc\"/></p>\n<p>对扩展实值函数（extended-real-valued function）应在整个底空间检验序列判据，并允许 <span class=\"math inline\">f(x)=+\\infty</span>；仅在有效定义域内检验不足以推出上境图闭性。</p>\n<p>参考：<a href=\"https://stanford.edu/~boyd/cvxbook/\">教材相应章节 / Reference</a>。</p>\n<section class=\"bibliography\"><h2>参考资料</h2><ol>\n<li id=\"reference-boyd-convex-optimization\"><a href=\"https://stanford.edu/~boyd/cvxbook/\">Convex Optimization</a> — Stephen Boyd; Lieven Vandenberghe · 2004 · Exercises 2.10, 2.18, 3.18, 3.57, 3.36, 4.24, 5.30（按原稿HW题号）</li>\n</ol></section>\n","id":"opt.lower-semicontinuity.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"opt.lower-semicontinuity","resources":[],"schema_version":1,"title":"下半连续性"}],"available_articles":[{"anchors":["definition","下半连续函数-lsc"],"english_title":"Lower Semicontinuity","id":"opt.lower-semicontinuity.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"opt.lower-semicontinuity","title":"下半连续性"}],"bibliography":[{"author":"Stephen Boyd; Lieven Vandenberghe","id":"boyd-convex-optimization","locator":"Exercises 2.10, 2.18, 3.18, 3.57, 3.36, 4.24, 5.30（按原稿HW题号）","source_path":"","title":"Convex Optimization","url":"https://stanford.edu/~boyd/cvxbook/","year":"2004"}],"contains":[],"content_status":"available","default_ar